-- ---------------------------------------------------------------
-- OPTIONAL — correct the stored coordinates.
--
-- The Negril points sit ~2.2-2.4 km from the beaches they name; they look like
-- representative seed values rather than surveyed positions. San Juan is 290 m
-- out, which is fine.
--
-- This does NOT materially change the live feeds: the AFAI sampling box is
-- 0.1 deg (~11 km) and the drift box 0.5 deg, so a 2 km offset already falls
-- inside both. What it fixes is the map — marker placement, callout anchoring
-- and where the arrival vector points — for segments left untraced.
--
-- Review, then uncomment to apply.
